    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for Luma's Dream Machine generative video and image platform.\nExposes Ray (video) and Photon (image) model families with endpoints for\ncreating, listing, retrieving, and deleting generations, plus upscaling,\nstyle-transfer modification, reframing, audio attachment, concepts, and\ncredit balance.\nAuthentication uses Bearer tokens obtained from\nhttps://lumalabs.ai/dream-machine/api/keys.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Luma Labs",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
